    '|a||It''s getting dark in Russian: темнеет, мне повезло':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5440
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Темнеет, мне повезло, что мне делать? Russian sentences with no subject, as Masha phones Tom from the sea in Sochi.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:17p5525'
    '|a||Ию́ль. Ма́ша отдыха́ет на мо́ре, в Со́чи, на Чёрном мо́ре.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6040
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Ве́чером она́ звони́т мне в Петербу́рг. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1pmqjpr'
    '|a||Ма́ша, приве́т! Как мо́ре?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:8d1tpg'
    '|b||Прекра́сно! Мне так повезло́ с пого́дой: жара́, на не́бе ни одного́ о́блака.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6280
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||А у нас дождь и хо́лодно. Ты загора́ешь?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Ка́ждый день, с ра́ннего утра́. Но вчера́ была́ гроза́, и я пришла́ домо́й совсе́м мо́края.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7240
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||А сейча́с что у вас?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1560
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Сейча́с темне́ет. Над мо́рем луна́. Мне не сиди́тся до́ма, пойду́ гуля́ть.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5600
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||А что ты де́лала днём?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1800
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Мы бы́ли на ло́дке. Лови́ли ры́бу, но ничего́ не пойма́ли!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4280
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Не повезло́! Зато́ ты действи́тельно отдыха́ешь.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4800
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Masha phones Tom from Sochi. What''s the weather like there? (жара́: heat · о́блако: a cloud)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8160
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Жара́, на не́бе ни одного́ о́блака.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3960
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||What happened to Masha yesterday? (гроза́: a thunderstorm · мо́края: wet)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Была́ гроза́, и я пришла́ домо́й совсе́м мо́края.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3800
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||What is happening in Sochi now? (темне́ет: it''s getting dark · луна́: the moon)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7920
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Сейча́с темне́ет. Над мо́рем луна́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||What did Masha do on the boat? (ло́дка: a boat · лови́ть / пойма́ть: to fish / to catch)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7720
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Лови́ли ры́бу, но ничего́ не пойма́ли!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Что сказа́ла Ма́ша? Сейча́с темне́ет.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3000
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Кто темне́ет? Никто́. Just the verb, in the он-form.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:qm5nr4'
    '|a||Так же: светле́ет — it''s getting light; моро́зит — it''s freezing.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:gxajna'
    '|a||В про́шлом — the neuter, in -о: ста́ло темно́, бы́ло жа́рко.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1447ufm'
    '|a||Посмотри́те. Темне́ет. Мне повезло́. Что мне де́лать?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1o0w3bx'
    '|a||Мне повезло́: I was lucky. Везти́ — to carry; повезти́ кому́ — to be lucky. Кому́ повезло́? Мне: the to-form, in purple.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:robdf3'
    '|a||Ста́ло темно́. Мне не сиди́тся: I can''t sit still. Куда́ нам идти́?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:n9s89f'
    '|a||Бы́ло жа́рко. Мне хо́чется спать — вы э́то зна́ете. Не тебе́ реша́ть: it''s not for you to decide.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:lwebck'
    '|a||Мне + infinitive: mostly questions, what am I to do? And «not for you to…»: не тебе́ реша́ть.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:k8djlf'
    '|a||И ещё: мне жа́рко, мне мо́кро. How it feels to me.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:rhaf8c'
    '|a||А Ма́ша сказа́ла: я мо́края. An adjective: what she is.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:y749oa'
    '|a||Но́вые слова́. Жара́: heat. Гроза́: a thunderstorm.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1634oc9'
    '|a||О́блако, облака́. А ве́чером над мо́рем луна́, на не́бе звёзды.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:i9po71'
    '|a||Мо́крый: wet. Сухо́й: dry.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:q1mmtr'
    '|a||Ло́дка. Лови́ть ры́бу: to fish; пойма́ть: to catch.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1o5e47v'
    '|a||Загора́ть: to sunbathe; загоре́ть: to get a tan. С ра́ннего утра́: from early morning.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:56gszf'
    '|a||Тепе́рь вы. Мне, меня́ и́ли я?':
